                                      margin-right:1px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"31\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"33\">2</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"35\" class=\"mq-binary-operator\">−</span><span class=\"mq-fraction mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"37\"><span class=\"mq-numerator\" mathquill-block-id=\"39\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"38\">4</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"41\" class=\"mq-operator-name mq-first\">l</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"42\" class=\"mq-operator-name mq-last\">n</var><span mathquill-command-id=\"44\">2</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"47\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"46\">3</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span></span></div></div>.</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>To find the instantaneous rate of change at a given point, we have to find <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"36\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac